        "text": "<!channel> :trumpet: Today we have launched the R Project Zulip! :rocket:\n\nWe have been testing out the Zulip for a few weeks with some invited contributors. We are now happy to open it to all R contributors.\n\nThe Zulip will replace this Slack - we encourage you all to\n\n• Sign-up at <https:\/\/r-project.zulipchat.com|r-project.zulipchat.com>. Note that we will not be migrating members from Slack to Zulip automatically.\n• Read our <https:\/\/contributor.r-project.org\/zulip|Zulip guide for R Contributors>.\n• A welcome bot will greet you when you first join with further pointers on effective participation.\nSee the full announcement post on the R Blog: <https:\/\/blog.r-project.org\/2026\/09\/22\/zulip-chat-for-the-r-project\/index.html|blog.r-project.org\/2026\/…\/index.html>",
